R-PB6 R-E6 R-AP10 R-AP34 R-J7 (slice 217): the answers of the registry for the one request (R-E6 for a write): 429 and 503 busy are exit 15, no answer (timeout, failed) is exit 15, 400 is exit 1 (internal), 422 is exit 20 (rejected). One request for each run, no `sleep`, no retry (R-AP34), share.json is not written (no 200 or 201). The lines come first and list the fact as not sent (Q498); the exit is the failure.
